OL,12,     GChilean-born saxophonist Melissa
OL,13,     GAldana, shares some of the jazz
OL,14,     Gartists that she has been
OL,15,     Ginfluenced by.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GItalian baritone Andre Schuen and
OL,18,     Gpianist Daniel Heide give a
OL,19,     Grecital at the Schubertiade
OL,20,     GSchwarzenberg in Austria,
OL,21,     Gincluding Wagner's Wesendonck
OL,22,     GLieder and Strauss's Four Songs.
